well we have some breaking news this  morning on another huge data breach the  Marriott hotel chain says it's  investigating an unauthorized access of  its Starwood reservation system that may  have put information from 500 million  guests at risk the affected data  includes customers addresses dates of  birth and passport numbers Marriott says  it'll notify all of those customers who  are affected and it has also set up a  dedicated website and call center that  will answer questions info dot Starwood  hotels dot-com the apparent hacking was  first noticed back in September but the  company says it learned that the  unauthorized access has been going on  since 2014
 

